				<Function Name="IPRGetDestinationPos" Comment="Returns the current moves Destination positions as 9*DINT values.&#13;&#10;aData[0] = Pos1&#13;&#10;aData[4] = Pos2&#13;&#10;etc.&#13;&#10;&#13;&#10;Called from the CNCInterpreter to update the current position after asynchronous M-Command is finished.">
